Delta Lake test tables from delta-rs
------------------------------------

Files: the delta-rs tables in tests/testthat/fixtures/delta-fixtures.tar
       (its tables/ entries checkpoint-v2-table, column_mapping,
       deletion_vectors, delta-0.8.0-null-partition, delta-0.8.0-partitioned,
       delta-2.2.0-partitioned-types, simple_table,
       simple_table_with_checkpoint, table-with-dv-small,
       table_failed_last_checkpoint_update, table_with_column_mapping,
       table_with_edge_timestamps, table_with_ict and
       v2-classic-checkpoint-json; the changed tables column_mapping_id_mode
       and table-with-dv-small-inline; and the hostile logs made from
       table-with-dv-small: dv-bad-checksum, dv-bad-magic and
       dv-size-past-file), and deltalake's answers for those tables under
       tests/testthat/fixtures/answers/.
Source: https://github.com/delta-io/delta-rs, crates/test/tests/data, at
        commit 40439ad6d37a9e99add5bd80796aa6179ebe339f.
